OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon crime concerns outweigh
OL,4,Areality, study suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are overestimating how much
OL,7,Fcrime takes place in London and how
OL,8,Funsafe residents feel, according to
OL,9,Fresearch by King's College London.
OL,11,FResearchers found that respondents
OL,12,Fthought that 30% of Londoners had
OL,13,Fpersonally experienced a crime in the
OL,14,Fyear between October 2024 and September
OL,15,F2025, when the reality was 12.2%,
OL,16,Faccording to ONS figures.
OL,18,FLondoners involved in the survey also
OL,19,Foverestimated the risk, putting the
OL,20,Ffigure at 25%.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
